;置き換える気がないならスルー。
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_CHILD_RAISING_つかまり立ち
;First Steps (with support, learning)
;-------------------------------------------------
CALL SET_KOJO_COLOR(93)
IF CHILD_MULTIPLE_FIRST(93, TALENT:93:育児中) != TALENT:93:育児中
	PRINTDATADL
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% starts to learn how to walk with %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother as well.
		DATAFORM %K93NICK()% starts teaching %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% how to walk. %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 1, TALENT:93:育児中)% %SPLIT_G(@"is quite the slow learner.:is learning it quite fast!")%
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% tumbles a few times, but is starting to walk with the help of %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother.
	ENDDATA
ELSE
	IF RAND:2
		PRINTFORML 「That's good, keep pushing the water away with your legs...」
		PRINTFORMDW You walk into %K93NICK()% holding %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)%'s hands as %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% lays flat above water.
		PRINTFORMDW The baby gracelessly kicks its legs, splashing water around and faintly propelling %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%self forward.
		PRINTFORMDW Eventually, %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother turns towards you with a shining on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lips.
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! You arrived at just the right time!」
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm trying to teach our %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)% how to swim, just like me.」
		PRINTFORML 「But say, I should let you teach %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% how to walk on land!」
		PRINTFORMW 「For obvious reasons, I'm not really fit for teaching %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% that...」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「That's it dear, don't be afraid to use me for support, one step at a time...」
		PRINTFORMDW You walk into %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% attempting to use %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% stubby little legs to walk, holding on the hand of %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother.
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% lets out a sigh of relief as soon as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% notices your presence.
		PRINTFORMW 「Faaah... It's a good thing that you're here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Our %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)% started to stand up and hold on to things, and taking small steps.」
		PRINTFORML 「I don't know much about walking, so I was starting to feel a bit lost on what to do...」
		PRINTFORMW 「But with you here, I'm sure %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% will start learning even faster!」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
;-------------------------------------------------


;-------------------------------------------------
;育児イベントの地の文。口上色はここで付けてください。
;CFLAG等のキャラ変数を使う場合、キャラ番号の指定が必要になります。
;デフォルトのものと置き換えたい場合は上下のSKIPSTART~SKIPENDを外してください。
;置き換える気がないならスルー。
;-------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_CHILD_RAISING_よちよち
;First steps (without support, look at %HIM_HER_CHILD(X, 0, TALENT:X:育児中)% go!)
;-------------------------------------------------
CALL SET_KOJO_COLOR(93)
IF CHILD_MULTIPLE_FIRST(93, TALENT:93:育児中) != TALENT:93:育児中
	PRINTDATADL
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% starts walking on %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% own. %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 1, TALENT:93:育児中)% is quite the fast runner!
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% starts taking %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% own steps, and despite often tripping over %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% always gets up again.
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% also starts to walk, but %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% has quite the weird step...
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% also starts to walk, almost as good as %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% swims.
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% takes the first step %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% first step into dry land.
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% skips walking and goes straight into sprinting. \@ CHILD_SEX:93:(TALENT:93:育児中) == 1 ? S-she # H-he\@'s fast!
	ENDDATA
	IF CHILD_MULTIPLE_COUNT(93, TALENT:93:育児中) >= 4 && CHILD_MULTIPLE_LAST(93, TALENT:93:育児中) && !RAND:20
		WAIT
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDL Seeing this many of your children marching in unison, you start fantasizing about taking over Gensokyo with your newly born army...
		PRINTFORMDW But you realize that you are in the wrong game for such ambitions.
	ENDIF
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, come here! Quickly, you have to see this!」
	PRINTFORMDW Hearing %K93NICK()% desperately calling your name, you quickly make your way towards %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
	IF RAND:2
		PRINTFORMDL When you arrive, you see %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% paddling around in the water near %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother.
		PRINTFORMDW While %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% has a lot to improve, you're pretty sure you've seen adults swimming worse than that.
		PRINTFORMW 「I just decided to set %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% down in the water, and then %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% suddenly started to swim!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Seeing our dear little %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)% finally swimming like that fills my heart with joy.」
