@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_CHILD_RAISING_しつけ
;Disciplining
;-------------------------------------------------
CALL SET_KOJO_COLOR(93)
IF CHILD_MULTIPLE_FIRST(93, TALENT:93:育児中) != TALENT:93:育児中
	PRINTDATADL
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% starts misbehaving too, but %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% listens to you as soon as you raise your voice.
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% also starts misbehaving, but a talk is all that it took for %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% to behave once again.
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% shows you %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% tongue when you try to correct %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%. It's almost too cute to be mad at, almost...
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% starts to misbehave as well. What is this, a rebellion?!
		DATAFORM %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% had started misbehaving, but %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% stopped as soon as you looked at %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%.
 	ENDDATA
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW You find %K93NICK()% sitting down with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% arms crossed, a frown visible on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% face.
	PRINTFORMW 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, there is something I want to talk about with you...」
	PRINTFORML 「You see, our %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% gravely misbehaved today.」
	IF CHILD_SEX:93:(TALENT:93:育児中) == 1 ;girl
		PRINTFORMW 「%HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 1, TALENT:93:育児中)% escaped my grasp and started walking away!」
		PRINTFORMW 「And when I called, %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%, %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% ignored me and kept walking.」
		PRINTFORML 「Fwuuuh... I did manage to catch up to and even scold %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%, but still...」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「%HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 1, TALENT:93:育児中)% ran away from my grasp, and went to play in a puddle of mud!」
		PRINTFORMW 「But the worst of it all, is that %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% didn't come back when called.」
		PRINTFORML 「Fwuuuh... I did manage to later grab and scold %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%, but...」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% pauses, the frown on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyebrows growing stronger.
	PRINTFORMW 「I don't think %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% listened to a single word of mine!」
	IF CFLAG:93:BirthEventsCount == 1 ;first child
		PRINTFORMW 「And I'm not sure if that is because this is my first child or if I'm too soft on everything.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「And I know I should have learned how to be more firm by now, but I don't think it's in my nature to that.」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMW 「So please, would you mind talking to %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%?」
	PRINTFORMW 「I'm sure you can manage to be more... assertive than me.」
	PRINTFORMDW You nod to %HIS_HER(93, 0)% request, taking the opportunity to talk to %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% as soon as you see %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)%.
	IF FLAG:甲斐性無 ;incompetent mode
		PRINTFORMDW And despite your usual posture, you manage to stomp your foot down and make %HIM_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% listen to you.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDW And unlike with %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% mother, %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% listens to every word of yours.
	ENDIF
ENDIF

