PRINTL
PRINTFORMDW One day, you see %K93NICK()% talking to %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% about %HIS_HER_CHILD(93, 0, TALENT:93:育児中)% future.
PRINTFORMW 「Say, %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)%... have you ever thought of what you want to do when you grow up?」
IF CHILD_LOVE:93:(TALENT:93:育児中) >= 200
	PRINTFORMDL %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% shines a brief yet warm smile before responding.
	SELECTCASE RAND:3
	CASE 0
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I was thinking of you know, studying fish, and whales and stuff like that.」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「If I'm not mistaken... I think they call that a \"marine biologist\"?」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufu～! Are you sure that profession of yours doesn't study mermaids as well～?」
		PRINTFORML 「Jesting aside, I think that's a good thing to look forward to...」
	CASE 1
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I've been thinking of becoming a musician, like... singing or playing the guitar.」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		IF ABL:MASTER:音楽技能 >= 3
			PRINTFORMW 「Oh! Just like your %PRINT_MALE("father_:other mother", MASTER)%, then?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Singing... Just like me, then?」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「I think that could work well, but you also have to think of something to do in case that doesn't work out...」
	CASE 2
		IF CHILD_SEX:93:(TALENT:93:育児中) == 1
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「W-well, I don't think I have that many ambitions in life.」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I might just... look for a husband as soon as I can, so I can be a good wife for him.」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		ELSE
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I might just... kick it back and the live the simple life of a farmer.」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 「Hmhmmm, I don't think there is anything wrong with keeping your life simple!」
		PRINTFORML 「If anything, I find that to be admirable, somehow...」
	ENDSELECT
	PRINTFORMDW They happily continue discuss the many choices for %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)%'s future career.
ELSE
	SELECTCASE RAND:3
	CASE 0
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I'm not really sure... might just wherever life takes me...」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh... That sort of apathy isn't healthy to have, don't you think?」
	CASE 1
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「Yeah, might just go around hunting youkai for a living!」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「Putting my life on the line, beating any youkai who dare stand in my way...」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		PRINTFORMW 「%SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)%! You shouldn't even think of something like that!」
	CASE 2
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「Yeah... Are you two sure I can't just keep living with you?」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"「I'll do chores, help around the house, keep myself out of trouble...」", K93_CHILDCOLOR(), 2, 0)
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm afraid that is not how things are, you need to get out there and be independent!」
	ENDSELECT
	PRINTFORML 「Instead of that, why don't we think of something else for you to do...」
	PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% spends good amount of time trying to convince %SHOW_CHILDNAME(93)% to seek a better future.
ENDIF

